{
  "id": "turnos-citas-cp4",
  "name": "Turnos / Citas - WhatsApp a FastAPI",
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "callerPolicy": "workflowsFromSameOwner",
    "availableInMCP": false
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "webhook-get-verificacion",
      "name": "Webhook GET (verificacion Meta)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [-260, -160],
      "webhookId": "turnos-citas-webhook",
      "parameters": {
        "path": "turnos-citas",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "Meta valida la URL con un GET que trae hub.mode, hub.verify_token y hub.challenge. Sin responder ese challenge no deja suscribir el webhook."
    },
    {
      "id": "verificar-token",
      "name": "Verificar token",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [-40, -160],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 3
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "verify-token-check",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.query['hub.verify_token'] }}",
              "rightValue": "<VERIFY_TOKEN>",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "responder-challenge",
      "name": "Responder challenge",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [200, -260],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "text",
        "responseBody": "={{ $json.query['hub.challenge'] }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200
        }
      },
      "notes": "El challenge se devuelve en texto plano, sin comillas ni JSON. Si se responde como JSON, Meta rechaza la verificacion."
    },
    {
      "id": "rechazar-verificacion",
      "name": "Rechazar verificacion",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [200, -60],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "text",
        "responseBody": "forbidden",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 403
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "webhook-post-mensajes",
      "name": "Webhook POST (mensajes)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [-260, 160],
      "webhookId": "turnos-citas-webhook",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "turnos-citas",
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "Mismo path que el webhook GET: n8n separa por metodo. Responde 200 de inmediato y sigue procesando: si esperara a Claude, Meta cortaria por timeout y reintentaria el mismo mensaje."
    },
    {
      "id": "filtrar-eventos-estado",
      "name": "Filtrar eventos de estado",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [-40, 160],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 3
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "hay-messages-check",
              "leftValue": "={{ !!$json.body?.entry?.[0]?.changes?.[0]?.value?.messages }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "WhatsApp manda 'enviado', 'entregado' y 'leido' a esta misma URL, con changes[].field valiendo 'messages' igual que un mensaje real. Lo unico que los distingue es si viene poblado value.messages o value.statuses. FastAPI tambien filtra; este IF evita el salto HTTP por cada notificacion."
    },
    {
      "id": "llamar-fastapi",
      "name": "Llamar a FastAPI",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [200, 60],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8000/webhook",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ $json.body }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "notes": "127.0.0.1 y no localhost: en Windows localhost resuelve a IPv6 y uvicorn escucha en IPv4. Se reenvia el sobre de Meta entero: el parseo vive en app/webhook.py, no en n8n."
    },
    {
      "id": "hay-algo-para-responder",
      "name": "Hay algo para responder",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [420, 60],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 3
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "respuesta-no-vacia",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.respuesta }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "respuesta vacia = no hay nada que enviarle al paciente (evento de estado o payload invalido que se colo). Es la misma senal que devuelve el endpoint en esos estados."
    },
    {
      "id": "responder-por-whatsapp",
      "name": "Responder por WhatsApp",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [660, -40],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://graph.facebook.com/v21.0/<WHATSAPP_PHONE_ID>/messages",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "Bearer <WHATSAPP_TOKEN>"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"messaging_product\": \"whatsapp\", \"to\": $('Llamar a FastAPI').item.json.telefono.replace(/^549(\\d+)$/, '54$1'), \"type\": \"text\", \"text\": { \"body\": $('Llamar a FastAPI').item.json.respuesta } } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "Responder 200 al webhook NO envia nada: el mensaje sale por este POST aparte. El .replace saca el 9 de los numeros argentinos, que Meta rechaza si no coincide exacto con como quedo registrado. Se referencia el nodo por nombre ($('Llamar a FastAPI')) y no con $json implicito, que se rompe al insertar un nodo en el medio."
    },
    {
      "id": "ignorar-evento-estado",
      "name": "Ignorar evento de estado",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [200, 300],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "nada-para-enviar",
      "name": "Nada para enviar",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [660, 180],
      "parameters": {}
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook GET (verificacion Meta)": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Verificar token", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Verificar token": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Responder challenge", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Rechazar verificacion", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Webhook POST (mensajes)": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Filtrar eventos de estado", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Filtrar eventos de estado": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Llamar a FastAPI", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Ignorar evento de estado", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Llamar a FastAPI": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Hay algo para responder", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Hay algo para responder": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Responder por WhatsApp", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Nada para enviar", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    }
  }
}
